  "details": "Let’s bring the “Share” button directly to Groups.\n\nThe existing “Share” button for emotes and stickers is already incredibly useful—now it would be fantastic to make groups just as easy to access.\n\nParticularly during music events, a group is essential for sharing announcements, calendar updates, and event organization. Right now, we must navigate through several menus just to open a group or join it. \n\nDJs frequently get distracted by a flood of friend requests during events, when it would be far more efficient for attendees to join the group directly instead.\n\nA simple, subtle group icon—perhaps dropped in front of the stage—would offer an elegant and intuitive solution: faster, more practical, and modern.\n\nThis feature could significantly streamline the routine of many event organizers. A small enhancement with a big daily impact.\n\nThank you for your excellent work and for listening to user feedback.",
